# Samsung sysfs nodes are not labelled by file_contexts:
# sysfs does not carry extended attributes, so the label has to be assigned by
# the kernel through genfscon. See genfs_contexts.
#
# This file is kept for the non-sysfs paths that need their own label.
#
# /dev/block/by-name/qmcs is mounted with an explicit `context=` option in
# fstab.emmc, so the block device itself needs no rule here.

