#
# Executable labels for the prebuilt vendor HALs.
#
# The stock vendor init scripts carry no seclabel, so the domain of every
# HAL is derived from the SELinux label of its binary through
# init_daemon_domain(). Every binary that AOSP/QCOM policy already labels is
# deliberately left out of this file.
#

